<h2 class="heading-size-2" id="weapons">Weapons and Offhands for Shadow Priest DPS Phase 2</h2>
<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="main-hand-weapons-for-shadow-priest-dps-phase-2">Main Hand Weapons for Shadow Priest DPS Phase 2</h4>
<a class="q5 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=46017/valanyr-hammer-of-ancient-kings">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_mace_99.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Val'anyr, Hammer of Ancient Kings</span></a> is of course the best of the best, giving more of almost everything we want on a piece of gear. Unfortunately, the proc does not work with any of our rotation, including <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/spell=15286/vampiric-embrace">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/spell_shadow_unsummonbuilding.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Vampiric Embrace</span></a>. <br/>
<br/>The difference in power between <a class="q5 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=46017/valanyr-hammer-of-ancient-kings">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_mace_99.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Val'anyr, Hammer of Ancient Kings</span></a> and <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=45620/starshard-edge">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_weapon_shortblade_92.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Starshard Edge</span></a> is also not huge, the main swap being either 44 Hit or 53 Crit &amp; 52 Haste. On the other hand, <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=45620/starshard-edge">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_weapon_shortblade_92.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Starshard Edge</span></a> will be sought after by every caster DPS, while the primary competition for <a class="q5 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=46017/valanyr-hammer-of-ancient-kings">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_mace_99.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Val'anyr, Hammer of Ancient Kings</span></a> is healing specs, alongside a select few DPS specs.<br/>
<br/>Outside of these two massively contested items, there are a fair few options, and most of them are close enough to each other.<br/>
<br/>
<b>Recommended BiS Weapon Enchants</b>: <br/>One-Handed <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/spell=60714/enchant-weapon-mighty-spellpower">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_enchant_formulasuperior_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Enchant Weapon - Mighty Spellpower</span></a> or <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/spell=59625/enchant-weapon-black-magic">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_enchant_formulasuperior_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Enchant Weapon - Black Magic</span></a>
